      "content": "it's just that there's nothing left for me. everyone talks about \"getting through it\" or \"staying strong,\" but there isn't anything on the other side. it's just more of this. i feel like i'm just a shadow waiting for the rest of me to catch up. like it would be so much more peaceful if it was just... over. for both of us.",
